# 1. Manually create a new repository in github.

# 2. Go to VSCode
#   a."clone a repository".
#   b.Enter all the command prompts from github.
#   c.Open folder. 

# 3. Start committing in VSCode
#   a. git add .
#   b. git commit -m "prompt".
#   c. git push origin main

# 4. Debug divergent branches
#   a. git pull --rebase
#   b. git push origin main 

# 5. Disable "!"
#   a. nano ~/.zshrc
    b. add "setopt BANG_HIST" to the file.
    c. Ctrl + X to save and exit.
    
# 6. Enable "!" again
#   a. nano ~/.zshrc
    b. change to "unsetopt BANG_HIST" in the file.
    c. Ctrl + X to save and exit.